Third-party material redistributed in this package
==================================================

File: data/dungan_counts.rda
Source: NCBI Gene Expression Omnibus (GEO), accession GSE195707
        https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE195707
Reference: Dungan, C. M., Brightwell, C. R., Wen, Y., Zdunek, C. J.,
           Latham, C. M., Thomas, N. T., Vechetti, I. J., Jr,
           Peck, B. D., Bamman, M. M., Murach, K. A., Englund, D. A.,
           Fry, C. S., McCarthy, J. J., & Peterson, C. A. (2022).
           Senolytic treatment rescues blunted muscle hypertrophy in
           old mice. GeroScience, 44(4), 1925-1940.
           https://doi.org/10.1007/s11357-022-00542-2
Description: Raw RNA-seq read counts (filtered to rows with min count
             >= 10 across samples) and sample-level metadata derived
             from the count matrix and series matrix files deposited
             at GEO accession GSE195707 by the authors of the
             reference above. Data were downloaded from NCBI GEO and
             reformatted; see data-raw/dungan_counts.R for the
             preparation script.
Notes: NCBI GEO data are released for unrestricted public use with
       attribution. The dataset is redistributed here for the sole
       purpose of providing a reproducible example for the seqwrap
       package; users citing this dataset should cite the original
       publication and GEO accession above.
